			],
			"Message": "docs(Sky): Standardize emoji spacing in architecture documentation\n\nAlign the `Documentation/GitHub/Architecture.md` file with the project's style guide by ensuring consistent spacing between section titles and their corresponding emojis. The previous format used non-breaking spaces or inconsistent whitespace which disrupted the visual flow in markdown renderers. Update all section headers (Overview, Architecture, Module Map, etc.) to use a single standard space character before the emoji icon.\n\nThis change maintains the integrity of the visual navigation aids while ensuring compatibility with standard markdown parsers and documentation viewers.",
			"SHA": "e76082c1521bc37361588b2df8d70aa9cf435cb5"
		},
		{
