				142,
				2
			],
			"Message": "docs(Sky): Add Architecture.md and normalize string formatting in Bridge\n\nIntroduce `Documentation/GitHub/Architecture.md` to document the Sky UI component layer. The guide details the Astro-based rendering pipeline, Tauri IPC integration, workbench variants (Mountain, Browser, Electron), and the SkyBridge event translation system between the WebView and VS Code workbench.\n\nSimultaneously, refactor `Source/Function/Sky/Bridge.ts` to normalize string literal syntax. Replace single quotes with double quotes for the `scriptSrc` fallback value and remove unnecessary semicolon prefixes on global assignment. Refactor `window.confirm` and `window.prompt` calls to use formatted template literals with explicit line breaks instead of embedded newlines, ensuring consistent formatting in browser dialogs.\n\nThese changes establish comprehensive architectural documentation for the editor UI and improve code style consistency within the bridge implementation.",
			"SHA": "2da022f0b76c81d4d70fd68e748b0cb783a7091f"
		}
